WEBVTT

00:01:29.106 --> 00:01:31.265
I had no idea why.

00:01:31.289 --> 00:01:32.900
And not knowing why at the time,

00:01:32.924 --> 00:01:34.589
well, that just got me more upset,

00:01:34.613 --> 00:01:37.299
so I eventually was just upset
for being upset.

00:01:37.323 --> 00:01:39.014
I took a deep breath -- (Inhales)

00:01:39.038 --> 00:01:40.464
and I let it out -- (Exhales)

00:01:40.488 --> 00:01:43.141
Thought that would help,
but no, it didn't.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:47.569
Then my brother walks in
with his smirky grin and he says to me,

00:01:47.593 --> 00:01:48.966
"What's wrong with you?"

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:50.966
I said, "Nothing, just leave me alone."

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:53.569
And he did, he ran as fast as he could.

00:01:53.593 --> 00:01:56.060
And you know what I did when he left.

00:01:56.538 --> 00:01:58.371
I cried even harder.

00:01:58.395 --> 00:02:02.402
I was ashamed and embarrassed,
just like when I was a kid.